                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "STRIKE ITEMS. - A Chinese servant employed by a Knutsford Terrace European was stabbed in the neck and head by two unknown Chinese at Kowloon yesterday. The first case under the Emergency Regulations forbidding the export of more than $5 from the Colony was heard at Kowloon Magistracy this morning when a Chinese coolie who tried to leave by the Canton train with $64.60 had the balance confiscated and the $5 returned to him.",
            "block_bbox": [
                2014,
                2440,
                2864,
                2817
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 14,
            "group_id": 14,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    2014.0,
                    2440.0
                ],
                [
                    2864.0,
                    2440.0
                ],
                [
                    2864.0,
                    2817.0
                ],
                [
                    2014.0,
                    2817.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Dr. S. W. T'so has been appointed\nController of Chinese Labour to act in\nconjunction with Mr. G. M. Young. His\noffice will be at the City Hall and\nChinese, whether British subjects or not,\nwilling to volunteer their services,\neither for general work or for the Police\nReserve should apply to him there without\ndlay.",
            "block_bbox": [
                2012,
                2816,
                2859,
                3124
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": 15,
            "group_id": 15,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    2012.0,
                    2816.0
                ],
                [
                    2859.0,
                    2816.0
                ],
                [
                    2859.0,
                    3124.0
                ],
                [
                    2012.0,
                    3124.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The meat workers went on strike today, also all workmen employed by Japanese. All bakers will be out by this evening; the coolies and the cargo-coolies are expected to strike tomorrow or the day after tomorrow. The vegetable coolies have decided not to strike but they will, it is said, to consider their decision should they be subjected to intimidation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                2027,
